### ============================================================
### 35-SpringRestClient HTTP Client API Testing (Port: 8135)
### ============================================================

### 1. Tạo sản phẩm mới
POST http://localhost:8135/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": null,
  "name": "Ultra-wide Monitor",
  "price": 450.00
}

### 2. Lấy danh sách sản phẩm
GET http://localhost:8135/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 3. Lấy sản phẩm theo ID
GET http://localhost:8135/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Cập nhật sản phẩm
PUT http://localhost:8135/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Ultra-wide Monitor 4K",
  "price": 499.99
}

### 5. Xóa sản phẩm
DELETE http://localhost:8135/api/products/1
